title: 'statement store: skip expired statements before sending'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    Statement gossip sent statements that had already expired. The receiver
    rejects them as `AlreadyExpired` and penalises the sender's reputation.
    Both send paths, propagation and initial sync, now skip expired statements
    while fetching, before they are encoded.
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    `sp_statement_store::Statement` gains `is_expired`, used by the gossip send
    paths and by the store's submit-time expiry check.
crates:
- name: sp-statement-store
  bump: minor
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: patch
